      "Trip: tourism. Arriving 20 November 2026, leaving 29 November 2026 on flight ZC 123. Two friends travel with me. We stay at the Harbour View Hotel, 10 Quay Road, Port Sample.",
      "Emergency contact: my sister Jamie Sample, +82 10 5550 0199.",
      "Declarations: no cash over the limit, no food or plants, no farm visits, never refused entry, no symptoms.",
      "I will attach the passport scan myself when you reach the upload — hand that one step to me.",
      "I agree to the declaration; I do not want advisory emails. Submit the form and tell me the reference number."
    ],
